ss =\"strong\">Ann</span>: I bought a one-way ticket to London.<br />  <span class =\"strong\">Bob</span>: You did what?? I didn't see that one coming!<br />"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\">Showing Interest </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\">Showing Surprise </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">And \u2026 ? / Ok \u2026 ? </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Really? </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">What is it? </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You did what?? </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">That's interesting! </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Are you kidding me? </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You bet! </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I didn't see that one coming! </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to tell "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to say something to someone "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have something important to tell you."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob09aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when you talk about a surprise trip!"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "one-way ticket "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a ticket to a destination, no return "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I bought a one-way ticket to Paris."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob09aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "return ticket "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a ticket to a destination and back "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  I bought a return ticket to Mexico. I'm going for a week."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob09aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to head to "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to leave; to go towards a destination "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm heading to Paris tomorrow."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob09aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "You bet! "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "You can be sure of it! "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: <span class = \"strong\">Ann</span>: I want to read all about it in your blog! <span class = \"strong\">Bob</span>: You bet!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob09aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "culture "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the history, art, etc. of a place "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I love French culture!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob09aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "the Old Continent "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "Europe "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to travel around the Old Continent."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob09aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Are you kidding me? "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "Are you serious?; Really? "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: <span class = \"strong\">Ann</span>: I bought a one-way ticket to Paris. <span class = \"strong\">Bob</span>: Are you kidding me?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob09aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "I didn't see that one coming! "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "I wasn't expecting this; I'm surprised "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Ann is leaving tomorrow. I didn't see that one coming!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob09aud09"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Simple Past Tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Simple Past tense to talk about a finished event or a specific time in the past.<br>  <br>You can form the regular form of the Simple Past tense by adding ed, -ied to the verb.</br>  <br>We use the auxiliary  <span class =\"strong\">did</span> to make negative and interrogative statements. Look at the chart."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Affirmative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Negative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Interrogative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You <span class =\\\"strong\\\">called</span> me last night.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You <span class =\\\"strong\\\">didn't call</span> me last night.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\">Did</span> you <span class =\\\"strong\\\">call</span> me last night?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She  <span class =\\\"strong\\\">wanted</span> a return ticket.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She <span class =\\\"strong\\\">didn't want</span>  a return ticket.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class =\\\"strong\\\">Did</span> she  <span class =\\\"strong\\\">want</span>  a return ticket?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Some verbs are irregular. Their Past Simple form doesn't end in -ed or -ied. Here are some examples:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Affirmative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Negative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Interrogative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"see\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I <span class =\\\"strong\\\">saw</span> you at the station.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I <span class =\\\"strong\\\">didn't see</span> you at the station.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\">Did</span> I <span class =\\\"strong\\\">see</span> you at the station?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bring\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I <span class =\\\"strong\\\">brought</span> my passport.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I <span class =\\\"strong\\\">didn't bring</span> my passport.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\">Did</span> I <span class =\\\"strong\\\">bring</span> my pasport?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"buy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I <span class =\\\"strong\\\">bought</span> a return ticket.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I <span class =\\\"strong\\\">didn't buy</span> a return ticket.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\">Did</span> I <span class =\\\"strong\\\">buy</span> a return ticket?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of three surprising or interesting things to tell a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "2 things are true. 1 thing is false."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Your partner expresses surprise each time you say something."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask your partner to guess which one is false. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Change roles."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about surprising things."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I show surprise with expressions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I determine what statements are true and which are false."}]}], "type": "sena"}